 the pandemic, ensuring that students have the necessary tools and materials for their learning needs.", "GOOGLE MEET:Google Meet is a video conferencing platform designed for virtual meetings and online lectures. It enables lecturers to conduct online meetings with students, facilitating remote communication and collaboration.", "ZOOM:Zoom is a video conferencing tool that facilitates virtual meetings and online lectures, making it particularly popular among lecturers for engaging with students. Its usage surged during the pandemic, as it provided a reliable platform for remote communication and collaboration.", "PANDEMIC:A global health crisis that has led to the implementation of online and hybrid lectures in educational institutions.", "HYBRID LECTURES:Hybrid lectures are a method of teaching that combines both in-person and online attendance, allowing students to participate in educational sessions regardless of their location. This approach became particularly prominent during the pandemic, as it facilitated learning for students who could not attend in person. Hybrid lectures necessitate the use of technology to connect in-person and virtual participants, which can require more energy and patience from lecturers to effectively engage all students, especially when addressing questions from those attending remotely.", "WEBCAMS:Webcams are devices used to capture video and images, essential for hybrid lectures to show the classroom environment to online participants.", "PROJECTORS:Projectors are hardware devices utilized to display information from laptops, primarily in educational and professional settings such as classrooms and meeting rooms. They serve a crucial role in hybrid lectures by projecting lecture materials for students attending in-person, thereby enhancing the learning experience and facilitating effective communication of information.", "AIR CONDITIONERS:Air conditioners are devices used to regulate classroom temperature, ensuring comfort during hybrid lectures.", "PROJECTOR:The \"PROJECTOR\" is a versatile output device primarily used in educational and professional settings to enhance visual communication. It serves to project visual data from computers onto larger screens, making it easier for audiences to view presentations, lecture materials, images, or videos. In classrooms, projectors are utilized to display educational content, facilitating learning for both in-person and offline students. They are commonly employed to showcase presentations created with software such as PowerPoint, ensuring that information is accessible to larger groups. Overall, the projector is an essential tool for enhancing visibility and engagement in various environments, including schools and public areas.", "AC:Air conditioning system used to regulate the temperature in the classroom during lectures.", "STUDENTS:Students are individuals engaged in learning, attending hybrid lectures that can be conducted either in-person or online. They often utilize laptops for educational purposes, taking advantage of their portability and functionality to enhance their learning experience.", "MI BOX:MI Box is a device designed to transform a regular television into a smart television by enabling Android functionalities. It serves as a technology that allows common televisions to access Android features, effectively converting an ordinary TV equipped with an HDMI port into a smart TV. This transformation provides users with internet connectivity and access to various streaming services, enhancing their viewing experience.", "INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY:Information technology encompasses the development and application of various technologies, including smart TVs, which enhance communication and access to information. It involves the creation of efficient software and hardware systems designed to support a wide range of operations and meet current technological demands. Through these advancements, information technology plays a crucial role in improving the way individuals and organizations interact with information and technology.", "ROBERTUS ADI SETYAWAN:Robertus Adi Setyawan is a student who studies networking and internet connectivity at college."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}